{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "fccb7e7336348e66553fbea0175ba33c17405ed7766aceb0174bdcffa1ac42e6", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，工作辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "3f28b338bd0003479243899b275dbe79cff1bd950e2f442a886607e7e3b25ea1", "ja": "さっきお預かりした背広、つくろい終わったので\n机に置いておきました♪　出来具合、どうですか？", "zh": "你刚才交给我的西装已经缝补好了，\n我放在办公桌上啰♪你觉得缝得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e927c6152e97a571238d6c50a95f85ac9890577f1a0ba22ff99a0ba8defb80a4", "ja": "おお、ばっちりだよ美奈子。いつもありがとう。\n今度、きちんとお礼をするからな。", "zh": "哦哦，很完美喔，美奈子。谢谢你每次都帮我缝。\n我下次会好好答谢你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "4cb34be638f22d6c28d43c3f1886f8fd72941bd02df43f548268ad2de9ab8664", "ja": "そんなそんな！　いいんです、\n私が好きでやってることなんですから。", "zh": "不用啦不用啦！\n不用在意，是我自己想缝的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "b180eaa10813f9dfe5848601b1711aec0b20acb7df28025348ac63930831ec27", "ja": "ポケットって、ほつれやすいんですよね～。\nこれからも、気を付けてくださいね？", "zh": "口袋这种地方，真的很容易破掉呢～\n今后也要多注意喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a7514b8ca2592c053ce42a151616dac8b4e091a3cc0b5dfe0e533e7f110d33e6", "ja": "ああ、気を付けるよ。つい、無理をして\n大きなものを入れてしまいがちだし。", "zh": "嗯，我会注意的。我实在很容易一个不留神，\n就硬把太大的东西塞进口袋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "6042323bb7791e10f407aa1365f1a7c069118db3e5dfb81320884affbdb84c16", "ja": "そうですよね～。ふふっ、この間の私たちぐらいなら、\nむしろ自分から入っちゃうかもしれませんし♪", "zh": "就是说啊～呵呵，如果像前阵子的我们那么小，\n搞不好反而会自己跳进去呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1007_p", "source_sha256": "be2cd97b9b5ba9ce98f18f2385d79a534b8099422e56270d7b0728290d24addc", "ja": "この間の？", "zh": "前阵子的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "91c6c90c9912401ef572b9e64c193bc30c3e60e75585a8b2f5a80cf5bd85b0dc", "ja": "ほら、私たちが小さくなっちゃうお仕事、\nしたじゃないですか。アヒルさんの上に乗ったりして！", "zh": "就是那个啊，不是接了一份我们变小的工作吗？\n还有坐在小鸭子上啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7c76f8c31217801db95e9949adf9176a636ffa3cd7003064445213fc7ad84114", "ja": "ああ、そういえば……。\nなかなか面白い仕事だったな、あれは。", "zh": "对喔，经你这么一说……\n那份工作很有趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "36c9b91b8160fa3c65691f53795e43972a97550c3667fb2eb45baed93463ddcd", "ja": "ポケットに入っちゃえば、いつも\n{$P$}さんと一緒にいられるから……", "zh": "如果进到口袋里，\n就能一直和{$P$}先生待在一起了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "1e85d663d29885247f0da2aac7f2abba652ad7a8025bc1aa5a2cb3a4a7c107de", "ja": "そしたら、どんな時でもお世話できるのになー、\nなんて。えへへっ♪", "zh": "要是真能这样，我就随时都能照顾你了说～\n开玩笑的，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1012_p", "source_sha256": "eb611e96eab6c4f2dc3ff23141055da755c23a7720ea16a088588eeab214a605", "ja": "そうなると、俺はポケットサイズの美奈子を\nプロデュースすることになるのか……。", "zh": "这样一来，\n我就得培育迷你尺寸的美奈子了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "31c4c29332d5cebdb06376e38c22aeb258a75275d8783482389694c9c0364ece", "ja": "あ、でも私が小さいままだと、あんまりたくさん\nご飯が作れないかも……？", "zh": "啊，但要是我一直都那么小的话，\n可能就没法做很多料理了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6e7bf957773dab6fa8e2b5fb7ab167899e96d1cb578de112c1e6801bd9da52ff", "ja": "はは。その通りだな。\nやっぱり、今のままの美奈子が良さそうだ。", "zh": "哈哈，就是说啊。\n看来还是现在的美奈子比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "6cc007787bac512a766fbc83f45c64d2222f8f3836663d5ac11ef14677e32927", "ja": "いえっ、よく考えたら、その方がいいです！", "zh": "不，仔细想想，还是变小比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
