{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "22cc5cf08b9c53cd7387f8c075257b912a851188a8a9bbc22fe22b7bb690e696", "ja": "だって、いくら作っても食べてもらえるってこと\nですよね♪　うう、腕が鳴るな～♪", "zh": "因为这么一来，不管我做再多你都吃得下对吧♪\n呜呜，我好跃跃欲试啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0063_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "95de74d7321e26805a1af141d817cfd0c86310b96a878d5465ae8b5d49e3a4a4", "ja": "小さい美奈子特製、ウルトラスーパー満腹フルコース！\n今度試作してみますから、食べてくださいね！", "zh": "小小美奈子特制的超级无敌饱足大餐！\n下次我试做看看，你要吃喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
